FSR for ETS2 and ATS (Windows x64)

Português

1. Feche o jogo e faça backup de qualquer dxgi.dll e pasta NeuralFX já instaladas.
2. Extraia dxgi.dll e a pasta NeuralFX para bin/win_x64, ao lado do executável do jogo.
3. Ajuste NeuralFX/neuralfx.ini conforme desejar.
4. Consulte NeuralFX/logs/neuralfx.log para confirmar o carregamento.

O pacote inclui a LUT Film Cool, obtida da biblioteca gratuita EditClips.online.

English

1. Close the game and back up any existing dxgi.dll and NeuralFX folder.
2. Extract dxgi.dll and the NeuralFX folder to bin/win_x64, next to the game executable.
3. Adjust NeuralFX/neuralfx.ini as desired.
4. Check NeuralFX/logs/neuralfx.log to confirm that the plugin loaded.

The package includes the Film Cool LUT from the free EditClips.online library.
